<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — Code-to-model traceability: 87/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each scored quantity is produced by a named function: jacobian, sigma_analytic, sigma_numerical, diffusivity_sweep, segment_trichome, spot_metrics. The math-KG card points at those laws and at the Lean declarations. Pass 2 does not add a second, looser implementation." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Same Schnakenberg law as pass 1, re-checked. k_c sits at 111.6 µm by construction of Du, and the grid dispersion tracks the continuum curve with r = 0.99991 and RMSE = 0.00336. σ(0) = -0.099 and σ(k_c) = 0.040, so the homogeneous state is stable and the critical mode is not. Equal diffusion at the geometric-mean diffusivity gives std(u) ≈ 3.6e-14 against a patterned std of 0.469. Lean checks the numerator sign and the mode counts on the scale ladder." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Law wavelength 111.6 µm, measured FFT wavelength 111.50 µm. Twenty-one spots, mean nearest neighbour 101.11 µm, CV 0.108, bootstrap 95% CI 96.60–105.81 µm (half-width 4.61 µm, not equal to the mean). KS D = 0.495 against Normal(111.6, 16.74), above the 5% critical value 0.297, so that normal is rejected and the rejection is kept. Specimen cyan area 0.094 versus simulated peak area 0.284. Specimen coherency 0.582 versus field coherency 0.715. Stochastic tail ratio 1.70 versus a null ratio of 1. Cell-scale predecessor mode count 0 versus 4 on this patch. Pearson r = 0.99991." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-cell-scale-predecessor-mode-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-pearson-r-continuum-vs-grid>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-control-amplitude-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-leaf-primordium-stripe-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-spacing-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-epidermis-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-trichome-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-trichome-cyan-area-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-stochastic-spectral-tail-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-trichome-nearest-neighbour-spacing>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-trichome-spacing-bootstrap-ci-half-width>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — MorphoEval overall 88.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 of the 111.6 µm Arabidopsis trichome-spot model. Dispersion Pearson r = 0.99991 (RMSE 0.00336). GIF fitness against the Paves SEM is CV 93.3 on 12 frames at 640×480. Image fitness using this pass's specimen-match and morphometric scores is 90.6. Signing remains unavailable. Overall 88.7/100 (faithfulness 88.6, reproducibility 89.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 7dbcb5f4ae37938efcf50ef7ff5969863bb80dbe; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 91, Morphological realism / specimen match 86, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 87, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 7dbcb5f4ae37938efcf50ef7ff5969863bb80dbe, image/png, 663781 B, 1512×1008 px, artifact_sha256 008bc69512d76ece0fad0bf0807adb9b77f18ee41bf605d57bc98f95d7c120d2 (sha256 008bc69512d76ece0fad0bf0807adb9b77f18ee41bf605d57bc98f95d7c120d2), spec_fingerprint c3c61462f42b93b82ab11c814de08014335238d29e5879ad1c5373a3aac7d878. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c3c61462f42b93b82ab11c814de08014335238d29e5879ad1c5373a3aac7d878; artifact_sha256: 008bc69512d76ece0fad0bf0807adb9b77f18ee41bf605d57bc98f95d7c120d2; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0/arabidopsis_thaliana_epidermis_stomata.jpg=4b7c1062f6ebfd6e..., datasets/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0/arabidopsis_thaliana_trichome_specimen.jpg=41f6702ee4687dd9..., datasets/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=baa7ea4e84cec45e..., datasets/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=fb11f832295b852c..., datasets/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=ecd8d065fc5e5570...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 gives k_c from the determinant of J - k^2 D. | Bouyer 2008 shows TTG1 is trapped by GL3 and depleted around trichomes. | Di Patti 2023 reports fat-tailed trichome power spectra. | Balkunde 2020 constrains an activator-inhibitor plus activator-depletion network with weak ttg1 alleles.; reconstructed_in_script: Two-component Schnakenberg kinetics with a=0.05, b=1, Dv/Du=8.4, λ_c=111.6 µm. | Periodic 446.4 µm patch, 128² spectral IMEX integrator, seed 3117. | Tail ratio 1.70 between a noisy run and the deterministic run. | Bootstrap 95% CI on nearest-neighbour spacing, 96.60–105.81 µm.; transfer_boundary: The catalog wavelength 111.6 µm is the assigned scale of this slot. It is not a spacing printed in Bouyer 2008 or Di Patti 2023. | The fat-tail comparison is a high-k power ratio, not a digitised copy of the Di Patti spectrum. | Integer Lean witnesses use the sign pattern of the Jacobian, not the floating-point entries.; does_not_claim: The three branches of the Paves trichome are not a prediction of the PDE. | The model is not the full Balkunde gene network and not the Di Patti birth-death master equation. | The Boutet epidermis dominant mode stays in pixels (480 px). It is not a micrometre wavelength. | datasets/species_gallery Arabidopsis_thaliana.jpg is Aeonium tabuliforme and is not a specimen for this loop. | Passing image fitness does not mean the spot lattice reproduces trichome branch geometry.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [provenance_lock/repro-package, pressure P=0.9]: Sign the pass-2 nanopubs once a nanopub profile exists.",
        "remediation needed: Nanopub signing is still blocked: ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is absent. Unsigned TriG is what this pass publishes locally." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.87e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — Parameter expressivity: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The diffusivity sweep is monotonic in activator amplitude once d clears the threshold between 6 and 8.4, and λ(argmax σ) moves from about 115 µm at d = 8.4 to about 138 µm at d = 20 while Du is held fixed. Subthreshold ratios are left off the wavelength panel because they have no selected mode. That is the expressivity claim for this 111.6 µm point." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm — Reproducibility package: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "--self-test passed after the pass-2 measurement block (bootstrap CI included). Seeds, hashes, and the metrics cache are deterministic. The remaining gap is cryptographic signing, which this environment cannot do without a nanopub profile. That gap is recorded rather than given a signature." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
